  h1="Nerve blocks and radiofrequency ablation"
  lede="Back pain does not always come from a herniation. Muscle spasm, arthritis of the small spinal joints and sacroiliac joint inflammation hurt differently and are treated differently. Here is what blocks exist, when radiofrequency ablation is needed and why hitting the exact source of pain matters."
  hub={{ name: 'Spine', href: '/en/treatment/spine/' }}
